uth Sudan, known for his unique music style of tech house and techno.\r\n\r\nHe produced several successful projects, which caught international attention, including  Burn Dem Bridges, Way Ur Touchin Me and Strangers. He has released music on notable labels such as Stay On Sight Recordings, Steel City Dance Discs, FFRR and Looking For Trouble.\r\n\r\nWhile not busy with productions, Skin on Skin performs worldwide, where he is known for his twisted DJ sets, which caught the of promoters such as Soenda, Into the Woods and Modular.\r\n\r\nSkin on Skin is known for his mix of techno and 909 classic house, consisting of groovy rhythms, bouncy bass steps, and trippy synthesizers with drill-infused vocal lines. He perfected this style over time, surprising audiences worldwide with what some describe as a “complete new genre”\r\n\r\nSkin on Skin | Boiler Room x AVA Festival 2022\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lylcsb8OhzU","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:5254900","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":17517816,"name":"Emmanuel Pasquale John"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["SOS"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/5254900-Skin-On-Skin","type":"artist","urls":["https://skin0nskin.bandcamp.com/","https://www.facebook.com/skin0nskin/","https://www.instagram.com/skin0nskin/","https://open.spotify.com/artist/5mnxMXIM6BNhVVTXnBatKa","https://soundcloud.com/skin0nskin","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCx_Ct-k6fTTmCrDF85jb9zw"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/59187/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"59187","image":"https://i.discogs.com/iZuFs-0psziFASvs1npwprO7pLKee459UDs-DgaxnXQ/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:315/w:420/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTU5MTg3/LTE2MDE1MDU4NDIt/ODQ4OS5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/Wnl22bLgTJp-rzGS1l4WOQQ0Vss67s20S1uu10jF1II/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTU5MTg3/LTE2MDE1MDU4NDIt/ODQ4OS5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"Brazilian singer-songwriter and music