s distribution including Warpmart and Bleep.\r\n\r\nRob Young's book “Warp” confirms that the catalogue numbers 008, 011, and 013 were unused.\r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:4227","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":[{"id":2382433,"name":"LEX•XX Remix Series"}]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/4227-Lex-Records","type":"label","urls":["http://www.lexrecords.com","http://instagram.com/lexrecords","http://www.facebook.com/Lexprojects","http://twitter.com/LexRecords","http://www.youtube.com/user/lexrecords","http://plus.google.com/+Lexprojects","http://myspace.com/lexrecords","http://soundcloud.com/lexrecords","http://vimeo.com/lexprojects","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lex_Records","https://lexrecords.bandcamp.com/"]}},"/api/discogs/label/7607/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"7607","image":"https://i.discogs.com/BMC28gllJdMjWfhtmppwW9P1xUqbBfIsgQZmh-DGGi4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:340/w:344/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTc2MDct/MTQ4NTc3OTk3NS03/MDc1LnBuZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/hBNUe20AMb5-GJs3kNU-1ZW1qJSPK6-w07q8xbwPWQk/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTc2MDct/MTQ4NTc3OTk3NS03/MDc1LnBuZw.jpeg","profile":"Label from London and founded by [A=Guy McCreery].\r\nAll music made primarily (but not exclusively) with computers synthesizers and turntables.\r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:7607","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/7607-Third-Ear-Recordings","type":"label","urls":["http://www.third-ear.net","http://third-ear-recordings.bandcamp.com/music","http://www.facebook.com/thirdearrecordings","http://plus.google.com/+thirdearrecordings","http://soundcloud.com/third-ear-recordings","http://third-ear-recordings.tumblr.com","http://twitter.com/THIRD_EAR","http://www.youtube.com/user/thirdearrecordings"]}},"/api/discogs/label/939827/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":